49,3,,status,Minako,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
50,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The Coastal Lodge is expensive for transport, but the Mountain Centre's rates are very low.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Toshio,,I can't support the Mountain Centre; the application process is too demanding for the organizers.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Minako,,"The Lodge allows everyone to stay together, which is the only way to get the year-groups mixing.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,I'm worried about sleep at the Mountain Centre. The Lodge seems more peaceful.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"I dislike the non-refundable deposit at the Lodge, but Campus is a logistical mess.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"If we choose the Lodge, we must be very careful with the fee to avoid last year's deficit.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, as long as the owner handles the meals, the organizers can actually train.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, isn't the social benefit of the Lodge worth the financial risk?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Minako. Quality of rest is paramount for the training.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Asuka,,I suppose the Lodge is the most logical choice if we rule out the other two.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I'll vote for the Lodge, provided we set a strict payment deadline.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"I'm in for the Lodge. No cooking, no lottery.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,Minako,,Lodge it is. It's the best for the club's unity.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I vote for the Lodge for the sake of sleep and sanity.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"I'll go with the Lodge, though I'll be watching the budget closely.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
